##############################################################################
#                                                                            #
#   FireSenseNet-600M  —  MODEL WEIGHTS EXCLUSION NOTICE                     #
#                                                                            #
#   File    : do_not_push_model_weights.onnx                                 #
#   Format  : ONNX (Open Neural Network Exchange), opset 17                  #
#   Size    : ~2.4 GB (float32)  /  ~1.2 GB (float16)  /  ~0.6 GB (int8)   #
#                                                                            #
##############################################################################
#
#  !! DO NOT COMMIT TRAINED WEIGHTS TO THIS REPOSITORY !!
#
#  Model weights are excluded from version control due to the following:
#
#   1. PROPRIETARY RESTRICTION
#      The FireSenseNet-600M weights are proprietary assets of the Mireye CCG
#      Engine project and must not be distributed through public repositories.
#
#   2. FILE SIZE
#      ~2.4 GB binary blobs are unsuitable for Git. Use Git-LFS or a dedicated
#      model registry instead.
#
#   3. SECURITY
#      Embedding weights in a public repo can expose training-data fingerprints
#      and adversarial vulnerabilities.
#
##############################################################################
#
#  HOW TO OBTAIN WEIGHTS
#  ─────────────────────
#
#   Production (authorised team members only):
#     curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $MIREYE_MODEL_TOKEN" \
#          https://registry.mireye.com/models/firesensenet/firesensenet_600m_v1.onnx \
#          -o weights/firesensenet_600m_v1.onnx
#
#   Expected SHA-256 (v1.0.0-600M / float32):
#     <sha256 hash provided through secure internal channel — not stored here>
#
#   ONNX Runtime inference:
#     import * as ort from 'onnxruntime-web';
#     const session = await ort.InferenceSession.create('weights/firesensenet_600m_v1.onnx');
#
##############################################################################
#
#  ARCHITECTURE REFERENCE  (weights correspond to modelConfig.ts)
#
#   Model          : FireSenseNet-600M v1.0.0
#   Parameters     : ~590 M (float32)
#   Components:
#     ST-GNN (20 layers, d=1024)       ~336M params
#     Cross-Attention (12 blocks)       ~201M params
#     Diffusion Module (8 DDIM steps)   ~ 50M params
#     Decoder + Misc                    ~  3M params
#
#   Input tensors (ONNX):
#     cell_features   [batch, n_cells, 8]       float32
#     adjacency_mask  [batch, n_cells, n_cells]  float32
#     wind_vector     [batch, 2]                 float32
#     time_step       [batch]                    int64
#
#   Output tensors (ONNX):
#     enhanced_ips      [batch, n_cells]          float32
#     attention_weights [batch, n_cells, n_cells] float32
#     pinns_residuals   [batch, n_cells]          float32
#
#   Trained on    : Mireye CCG Engine wildfire dataset
#   Physics loss  : Rothermel PDE (∂I/∂t + v·∇I = α∇²I + S)
#   PINNS ref     : Raissi et al. 2019 (Nature)
#   GNN ref       : Veličković et al. 2018 (GAT)
#   Diffusion ref : Ho et al. 2020 (DDPM), Song et al. 2022 (DDIM)
#
##############################################################################
#
#  GITIGNORE STATUS:  This file is tracked in .gitignore under:
#                     *.onnx  →  entire class of ONNX weight files excluded
#                     weights/  →  weight directory excluded
#
#  This placeholder file itself is committed to document the exclusion.
#  Any actual *.onnx weight file placed alongside this will be ignored by git.
#
##############################################################################
